/ Stage 8h (decision 158): "if %done%, return %x%" puts the return inside the if's body. Beside the if it would
/ return always (or be refused by the chain check).
Start
- call Early done=true, write to %result%
- assert %result% equals "early"
- call Early done=false, write to %result%
- assert %result% equals "late", "the return is inside the if, so a false condition runs on"

Early
- if %done% is true, return "early"
- return "late"
